Revision history for Ham-RTTY

0.001  2026-10-25
    - Initial release for ITU-R M.1677-1 Morse symbols and operational signals.
    - Control Farnsworth timing and produce timed or sample-based events.
    - Generate tones, PCM WAV audio and standard MIDI files.
    - Use library and command-line interfaces for files, bytes and sample streams.
    - Audio reception is experimental, with multichannel decoding and mark SNR.
    - Include structured errors, diagnostics, POD references and runnable examples.
    - Require Perl 5.20 or later; PDL is an optional numerical backend.
    - Publish complete POD and Markdown docs in a Perl-themed GitHub Pages site.
